ormation and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Making and Responding to Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modal verbs, <span class=\"italic\">can, could</span> and<span class=\"italic\"> would</span> to make requests.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use these phrases to respond to requests:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Certainly.<br> Not at all. <br> Yes. <br>Of course.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use these modals to make requests:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Modal Verb \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" can \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you pick me up on the way?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" could \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you text me later with the details?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" would \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you mind if I came with you?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "marvelous ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "excellent; wonderful ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's a marvelous day for a hike.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about daily routines.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tranquil", "type": "name"}, {"content": " peaceful; calm ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's so tranquil on the mountain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sunrise ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the moment the sun comes up in the morning", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I love to watch the sunrise on the mountain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "air", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the invisible gas surrounding the earth; in part oxygen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The air is so clean and fresh.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fresh", "type": "name"}, {"content": "clear; not dirty", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I love the fresh air on the mountain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "on your way ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in the course of a journey ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you pick me up on your way?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "ready ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "available; prepared ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll be ready when you pick me up!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Interview your partner about how they like to relax.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down their response.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use their answers to write a paragraph (8-10 lines). ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read it back to them to check if the information is right.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I interview my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 8-10 lines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph to my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use adverbs of frequency.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le12ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le12ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: It's a marvelous day for a hike.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It is! I always love how fresh the air is up here on the mountain.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Yeah, I often come up here to think. It's so tranquil."}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "12000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How often do you come here?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Almost every day.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Every day? Where do you find the time?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I usually come here in the early morning. There's no one around and I love to watch the sunrise. It makes me think of you ..."}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "25050", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How romantic. Would you mind if I came with you one morning? I would love to watch the sunrise with you ...<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Not at all ... I would like that! I get up at 5:30 every day. I usually work out and then drive out here for the sunrise."}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "41000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Could you pick me up on your way? I'll be ready! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Certainly, Vanessa. Anything for you."}], "coverimg": "engenn5le12ob09re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: It's a marvelous day for a hike.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It is! I always love how fresh the air is up here on the mountain.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Yeah, I often come up here to think. It's so tranquil.<br><br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How often do you come here?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Almost every day.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Every day?! Where do you find the time?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I usually come here in the early morning. There's no one around and I love to watch the sunrise. It makes me think of you \u2026<br><br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How romantic. Would you mind if I came with you one morning? I would love to watch the sunrise with you \u2026<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Not at all ... I would like that! I get up at 5:30 every day. I usually work out and then drive out here for the sunrise.<br><br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Could you pick me up on your way? I'll be ready! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Certainly, Vanessa. Anything for you.\n", "type": "p"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "text", "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk abo